# inputs/

Static input files for FATORI-V system.

## Subdirectories

hardware/   - SystemVerilog files, constraints
software/   - C headers, linker scripts
others/     - YAML configs (fatori_registers.yaml, system_dict.yaml)
tcl/        - TCL input scripts (sem_gen.tcl, report_gen.tcl)

## Files

hardware/locations.yaml - Maps hardware files to architecture
software/locations.yaml - Maps software files to architecture
others/fatori_registers.yaml - Register monitoring definitions
others/system_dict.yaml - Static FI target definitions